%% fsm-contract: {"steps":["observed","merged","persisted","retrieved","photo-selected","projected","rendered"],"globalStateChange":false,"eventLifecycleChange":false,"asksQuestions":false}
%% This contract is checked by test/fsm_mermaid_contract_test.dart.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> observed: normal conversation provides an explicit fact
  observed --> merged: ProfileEngine updates the fact and confidence
  merged --> persisted: write local SQLite snapshot
  persisted --> retrieved: future turn loads the current snapshot
  retrieved --> merged: newer explicit fact
  retrieved --> photo-selected: local avatar selected from camera or gallery
  photo-selected --> persisted: save local photo reference
  retrieved --> projected: known facts only, priority sorted
  projected --> rendered: Profile View with completeness score

  note right of merged
    This is a profile-fact lifecycle,
    not an EventStatus lifecycle.
    No DiabotGlobalState changes.
  end note